/**

@page error Error management

@tableofcontents

Two mechanism are used in Xlsxwriter++ for error management:
- Contracts for code issues and wrong usages of Xlsxwriter++.
- Throwing exceptions for runtime errors.

@section contract Contracts

Errors related to usage of library like authorised values, function prerequisite, etc. are managed through programmation by contracts.

Such contracts are documented and callers are responsible of their respect. In debug mode, asserts check these contracts.

@section exception Throwing exceptions

Runtime errors are reported by throwing exception, standard ones for errors reported by standard library and `%xwpp::xwpp_exception_t` for errors
reported by Xlsxwriter++. Usage of `%xwpp::xwpp_exception_t` are documented in function description.

*/
